permit (principal is User, action == Action::"accessApplication", resource is PatentApplication)
when { ((((principal.clearance == 0) || (principal.clearance == 1) || (principal.clearance == 2)) && ((resource.confidentiality == 0) || (resource.confidentiality == 1) || (resource.confidentiality == 2))) && ((principal.roles.contains(Role::"PatentAttorney") || principal.roles.contains(Role::"DocketClerk") || principal.roles.contains(Role::"Examiner"))) && (!(true) || (principal.clearance >= resource.confidentiality) || (context.courtOrder && (principal.roles.contains(Role::"PatentAttorney") || principal.roles.contains(Role::"DocketClerk") || principal.roles.contains(Role::"Examiner")))) && (((("underExamination" == "filed") && (resource.status == PatentApplicationStatusValue::"filed")) || (("underExamination" == "underExamination") && (resource.status == PatentApplicationStatusValue::"underExamination")) || (("underExamination" == "allowed") && (resource.status == PatentApplicationStatusValue::"allowed")) || (("underExamination" == "abandoned") && (resource.status == PatentApplicationStatusValue::"abandoned")))) && ((principal.roles.contains(Role::"DocketClerk"))) && (resource.team.contains(principal))) };
